+/* "LiveHime captions" OBS source: shows the live caption on the canvas,
+ * bottom-aligned, keeping the most recent words when the sentence is longer
+ * than the box. Like the danmaku overlay it wraps a private FreeType text
+ * source; this hub receives caption events on the UI thread. */
